    pr_ref:  # c755
    description: ""  # c755
    fields:  # c755
      statement: "hypergumbo's secret_scan_cached invokes 'gitleaks detect --no-git --pipe', passing the sketch text on stdin. In gitleaks v8.30.0, --pipe mode ignores stdin and scans the cwd instead, so scan_content always returns []. The 'Secret scan complete' message is shown regardless. Sketches with detectable secrets (AWS keys, Slack tokens, RSA private keys) pass through unfiltered."  # c755
      root_cause: "gitleaks --pipe semantics changed; hypergumbo never validates the integration. The 'INF scanned ~169MB' line from gitleaks when given 41 bytes of stdin is the smoking gun — it never read stdin, it scanned cwd."  # c755
